    "answer": {
      "short": "$9\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "A cube has six equal square faces. Let its side length be $s$ metres.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}6s^2&=486\\\\s^2&=\\frac{486}{6}\\\\s^2&=81\\\\s&=9\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$",
